// Reads /seed/data/*.json (generated by `npm run seed`) and holds mutable
// adapter state. Mock adapters are pure readers of seed data — they never
// generate content themselves (ARCHITECTURE.md).
//
// Mutable state is PERSISTED through the validator's adapter_state table
// (migration 002): hydrated once per process inside withMockLatency(), and
// written through by persistNs() after each mutation. state() stays
// synchronous so adapter code reads it exactly as before.
